---
// C Guarantee — erstatter Garanti.astro for /c/-flowet.
//   • Mørk-brun split som B
//   • Bruger var(--c-bg-deep) → ÉN sandhed for dyb brun
//   • Indrammer det som "vores løfte" mellem proces og pris
---

<section class="c-guarantee" id="garanti" aria-label="Vores garanti">
  <div class="c-guarantee-grid">

    <div class="c-guarantee-img">
      <img
        src="/img/straatag1-hero.jpg"
        alt="Tækkemand Carlsen håndværker i gang med stråtag"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="c-guarantee-content">
      <div class="c-guarantee-inner">
        <span class="c-guarantee-eyebrow">Vores løfte</span>
        <h2 class="c-guarantee-h2">
          Levering <span class="c-guarantee-italic">indenfor 90 dage</span> — garanteret.
        </h2>
        <p class="c-guarantee-body">
          Hos Tækkemand Carlsen kan du stole på vores erfaring som tækkefirma. Vi tilbyder en bred
          vifte af behandlinger til vedligeholdelse af stråtage — alt arbejde udføres efter
          Tækkelaugets vejledning "Veludført Stråtag".
        </p>

        <ul class="c-guarantee-list">
          <li>
            <span class="c-guarantee-check" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 10 10" fill="none">
                <path d="M2 5l2.5 2.5L8 2.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span>Alt arbejde efter Tækkelaugets standard</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="c-guarantee-check" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 10 10" fill="none">
                <path d="M2 5l2.5 2.5L8 2.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span>God projektstyring giver leveringsgaranti</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="c-guarantee-check" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 10 10" fill="none">
                <path d="M2 5l2.5 2.5L8 2.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span>Materialer i den bedste kvalitet</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="c-guarantee-check" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 10 10" fill="none">
                <path d="M2 5l2.5 2.5L8 2.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span>Forsikret hos Alm. Brand op til 12 mio. kr</span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <p class="c-guarantee-foot">
          Vi lever af tilfredse kunder — og leverer altid et færdigt resultat til aftalt tid.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .c-guarantee { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .c-guarantee-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    min-height: 560px;
  }
  .c-guarantee-img {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 400px;
  }
  .c-guarantee-img img {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%; height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: 50% center;
  }
  .c-guarantee-content {
    background: var(--c-bg-deep);
    color: var(--c-white);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 80px 32px;
  }
  .c-guarantee-inner { max-width: 520px; }

  .c-guarantee-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-label);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255, 220, 193, 0.75);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .c-guarantee-h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 3.6vw, 2.6rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--c-white);
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .c-guarantee-italic { font-style: italic; color: #ffdcc1; }

  .c-guarantee-body {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(253, 249, 248, 0.82);
    margin: 0 0 28px;
  }

  .c-guarantee-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .c-guarantee-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 14px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    color: rgba(253, 249, 248, 0.92);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .c-guarantee-check {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 3px;
    width: 22px; height: 22px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255, 220, 193, 0.18);
    color: #ffdcc1;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .c-guarantee-foot {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(253, 249, 248, 0.7);
    margin: 0;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .c-guarantee-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .c-guarantee-img { min-height: 0; }
    .c-guarantee-content { padding: 80px 56px; }
  }
</style>
